  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup unsalted butter, softened",
    "0.5 cup white sugar",
    "2 teaspoons vanilla extract",
    "2 teaspoons water",
    "2 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1 cup finely chopped almonds",
    "0.25 teaspoon salt",
    "0.5 cup powdered sugar, or more as needed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CwRTsbdND9FjIC9CRNYShD3yRcM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-15542-mexican-wedding-cookies-ddmfs-4x3-ingredients-5309ac5f66c94bf695e4a86715008163.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15542/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat butter and sugar in a medium bowl with an electric mixer until light and fluffy. Mix in vanilla and water. Add flour, almonds, and salt; beat on low speed until dough is just combined. Cover and chill for 1 to 3 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yhT5g3XUm2a9rBoMXxsDFhaPZVk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-15542-mexican-wedding-cookies-ddmfs-4x3-step-02-6f1dcfe99ebe4c03b9a7c6334c51d14a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15542/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 325 degrees F (165 degrees C). Shape chilled dough into 1-inch balls.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3mYTcs63HGbfpOh1Bggvurpa6cc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-15542-mexican-wedding-cookies-ddmfs-4x3-step-03-5bce67d1aba84bed98214c068986412d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15542/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place 2 inches apart onto unlined cookie sheets.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dN7kPgB03CEIgjdSdzJ4J1jwXYA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-15542-mexican-wedding-cookies-ddmfs-4x3-step-04-9b1802339aa9441d9ae7317aea45eaa9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15542/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven for 15 to 20 minutes. Remove cookies from the sheets and transfer to wire racks to cool, 20 to 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Qi6Y2NGfx8K2vyXyXhKJEePsw78=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-15542-mexican-wedding-cookies-ddmfs-4x3-step-05-c694bc9adecb4a99a74d094351160e95.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15542/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place powdered sugar in a shallow bowl. Roll cooled cookies in powdered sugar to coat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hWWjU_0pjNP08h1CLPiwm22ydnE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-15542-mexican-wedding-cookies-ddmfs-4x3-step-06-5640dbb0dcf444b4b5c0fb4cd0c75093.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15542/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer to an airtight container and store at room temperature.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/M_udPPOGlob7nYFY9L3vEEBP30A=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-15542-mexican-wedding-cookies-ddmfs-4x3-bafd7f7b603a4cf58b01926f3d85e3b8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15542/step_07.webp"
